comments.body:
@dzole0311, not sure if all - i haven't looked into them all - but some of the tabs should still be relevant. the COG tab, for example, lets users put in render params (bands, colormap, rescale, etc). The legend lets users add a legend for a particular layer, and time allows time-based tile change i think.

I'd say that we keep these for now and only remove them once we're fully sure they're not useful.

I think we'll need to overhaul the way the configuration options are provided to users anyway in the future since there's a lot of other things that aren't really constrained (the user themselves have to determine what works for a particular option instead of the ui only providing the acceptable options). so i think it'll have to be a larger effort in the future - so i wouldn't worry about doing it right now.
